# Vercel deployment ignore patterns (root level)
# NOTE: `dist/` is intentionally NOT ignored here so the frontend build output
# (frontend/dist) is available when this repo root is used as a project root.
# Each folder (frontend/, backend/) is meant to be its own Vercel project with
# Root Directory set to that folder — see each folder's vercelignore.
backend/
.venv/
.env
.env.example
__pycache__/
*.pyc
alembic/
pytest.ini
requirements.txt
seed.py
tests/
.pgdata/
.pytest_cache/
node_modules/
*.md
!.vercelignore
!.vercel.json
!frontend/
!frontend/dist/
